    "prompt": {
      "description": "A shield bearer holding a door. A huge square plank shield, wider and taller than the person behind it, held flat and square to the front: bare timber planks divided by two vertical seams, one single broad iron band crossing the full width at the middle of the shield, a broad flat iron plate along the top rim reading as the thickness of the slab seen from above, a hard dark edge top and bottom, an iron rail along the bottom and a thin iron strip down each side. The head sits low behind the shield so only the crown, brow and two dark eyes clear the top rim; no shoulders, arms or torso are visible at all. Two boots splay out below the bottom edge.",
      "must_include": [
        "a huge square plank shield wider and taller than the figure behind it",
        "the shield held flat and square to the front, all four edges straight and axis-aligned",
        "two vertical seams dividing the shield into three timber planks",
        "exactly one broad horizontal iron band, crossing the full width at the middle of the shield and unbroken where it passes the plank seams",
        "a broad flat iron plate along the top rim of the shield, reading as the thickness of the slab seen from above",
        "the head sunk behind the shield so only the crown, brow and eyes clear the top rim",
        "two boots splayed below the shield's bottom edge and no other body part visible"
      ],
      "must_avoid": [
